  startMessage:
    overrideName: Haii!\n thank you for playing through my tutorial, if you would
      like to continue the tutorial onto some more advanced mechanics press the button
      on the bottom right, if not you can return to the main menu and play my rouge
      like mode. Once you are finished with that i would really appreciate it if
      you where able to fill in my form describing your playthrough of my game and
      your thoughts on it. If possible a gameplay recording would be appreciated
      but i understand you may not have the time.
